    fix(r11-owner-flowcap): delete the high-limit cap from _boost_ceiling_c
    
    _map_inputs, its only caller, already takes min(boost, _space_limit_c), so
    the second cap was an equivalent mutant (GUARD_OFF survived the FLOWCAP block).
    The docstring now points at _map_inputs, where the boost is capped.

